{
 "_why": "LEVEL 1 THE FOUNDRY, the tutorial rebuilt for NIGHT27 (builder A; GG: 'the tutorial section is fine but kind of repeats similar things'): TEN stages, one lesson each, nothing repeated: 1 move + look, 2 jump + a pad hop, 3 dash across a gap, 4 wall jump up a shaft, 5 the WALL RIDE hall (a telegraph-only hazard strip, no damage), 6 slide under a gap, 7 the pistol and its charge, 8 the PULSE (five kills, the LT launch over a pit), 9 ONE fight room (8 enemies, 2 kinds; the shotgun is earned), 10 THE LANTERN (a 30 m ring arena with wall segments; builder B supplies the boss). The old platforming runs (p1-p3) and the four husk rooms (s4-s7) are merged away. Rooms are NIGHT26's tutorial rooms moved along z (Design/levels/n26/tutorial.plan.json is what --off27 loads).",
